<span id="S4.T5.3.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Hall.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T5.3.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="S4.T5.3.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
